          %p
            %em
              Note: This page is about
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/categories"} categories
              (in the sense of
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} category theory
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/syntax"} syntax
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/terms"} terms
              belong to one syntactic category and
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/formulas"} formulas
              to another. For this usage, see also
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/categorial+grammar"} categorial grammar
          %h1#contents Contents
          .maruku_toc
            %ul
              %li
